00:14:16.388 --> 00:14:18.724
CONDEMN THE AZERI AND TURKISH

00:14:18.791 --> 00:14:19.725
GOVERNMENTS FROM THEIR CONTINUED

00:14:19.792 --> 00:14:22.127
