00:14:43.816 --> 00:14:44.950
TO THE LARGEST ARMENIAN AMERICAN

00:14:45.017 --> 00:14:46.385
POPULATION IN THE UNITED STATES.

00:14:46.452 --> 00:14:47.386
CALIFORNIA'S RECOGNITION OF THE

00:14:47.453 --> 00:14:49.421
ARMENIAN GENOCIDE IS CRUCIAL. AS

00:14:49.488 --> 00:14:50.522
THE PHILOSOPHER GEORGE SANTAYANA

00:14:50.589 --> 00:14:53.759
