00:14:53.826 --> 00:14:56.095
THE PAST ARE DOOMED TO REPEAT IT

00:14:56.161 --> 00:14:57.329
, AND SO WE MUST PERSEVERE IN

00:14:57.396 --> 00:14:58.264
REMEMBERING THE ARMENIAN

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.866
GENOCIDE, BECAUSE THERE ARE SO

00:15:00.933 --> 00:15:01.900
MANY PARALLELS TO WHAT'S

00:15:01.967 --> 00:15:03.168
