00:15:03.235 --> 00:15:04.236
TODAY. MUCH LIKE THE UNITED

00:15:04.303 --> 00:15:06.438
STATES, THE OTTOMAN EMPIRE WAS A

00:15:06.505 --> 00:15:08.340
GREAT NATION STATE BASED ON A

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:08.741
LONG TRADITION OF

00:15:08.807 --> 00:15:10.142
MULTICULTURALISM AND RELIGIOUS

00:15:10.209 --> 00:15:11.910
TOLERANCE. BUT AS IT BEGAN TO

00:15:11.977 --> 00:15:13.545
FALTER ON THE WORLD STAGE, IT

00:15:13.612 --> 00:15:15.381
BECAME TAKEN OVER BY A HYPER

00:15:15.447 --> 00:15:16.715
NATIONALIST REGIME THAT

00:15:16.782 --> 00:15:19.885
DEMONIZED AND MARGINALIZED

00:15:19.952 --> 00:15:20.519
MINORITY COMMUNITIES, INCLUDING

00:15:20.586 --> 00:15:21.954
NOT ONLY THE ARMENIANS, BUT ALSO

00:15:22.021 --> 00:15:23.889
GREEKS AND ASSYRIANS. THIS

00:15:23.956 --> 00:15:25.557
EVENTUALLY LED TO THE HORRORS

00:15:25.624 --> 00:15:27.326
THAT WE NOW KNOW AS THE ARMENIAN

00:15:27.393 --> 00:15:29.261
GENOCIDE, WHERE OVER 1.5 MILLION

00:15:29.328 --> 00:15:30.329
ARMENIANS WERE SYSTEMATICALLY

00:15:30.396 --> 00:15:33.265
EXTERMINATED IN THIS HORRIFIC

00:15:33.332 --> 00:15:34.933
GENOCIDE WAS LARGELY IGNORED BY

00:15:35.000 --> 00:15:36.535
THE REST OF THE WORLD AND THEN

00:15:36.602 --> 00:15:38.337
MOSTLY FORGOTTEN. AND THIS LED

00:15:38.404 --> 00:15:40.205
DIRECTLY TO THE INSPIRATION OF

00:15:40.272 --> 00:15:43.008
ADOLF HITLER, WHO FAMOUSLY SAID,

00:15:43.075 --> 00:15:44.143
WHO, AFTER ALL, SPEAKS TODAY OF

00:15:44.209 --> 00:15:46.512
THE ANNIHILATION, ANNIHILATION

00:15:46.578 --> 00:15:47.713
OF THE ARMENIANS AND JUSTIFYING

00:15:47.780 --> 00:15:49.782
THE ATROCITIES OF HIS OWN

00:15:49.848 --> 00:15:50.949
REGIME, IT IS ESSENTIAL TO

00:15:51.016 --> 00:15:53.085
REMEMBER THIS AS WE SEE THAT

00:15:53.152 --> 00:15:54.053
ALARMING RISE OF

00:15:54.119 --> 00:15:56.221
AUTHORITARIANISM AND HYPER

00:15:56.288 --> 00:15:57.256
NATIONALISM ACROSS THE WORLD,

00:15:57.323 --> 00:15:58.324
INCLUDING HERE IN THE UNITED

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:00.926
STATES. SO TO TRULY HONOR THE

00:16:00.993 --> 00:16:01.960
ARMENIAN GENOCIDE, WE MUST

00:16:02.027 --> 00:16:03.996
CONTINUE TO RECOGNIZE IT AND

00:16:04.063 --> 00:16:04.997
STAND UP AGAINST GENOCIDE

00:16:05.064 --> 00:16:06.498
EVERYWHERE, INCLUDING THE

00:16:06.565 --> 00:16:07.499
ATTACKS ON ARTSAKH BY THE

00:16:07.566 --> 00:16:09.802
TURKISH GOVERNMENT AND ITS

00:16:09.868 --> 00:16:12.871
PROXIES. SO I WANT TO THANK THE

00:16:12.938 --> 00:16:14.039
AUTHOR AGAIN AND RESPECTFULLY

00:16:14.106 --> 00:16:15.874
ASK FOR YOUR AYE VOTE. THANK

00:16:15.941 --> 00:16:23.549
YOU, SENATOR ARCHULETA. THANK

00:16:23.615 --> 00:16:27.152
YOU, MR. PRESIDENT. I RISE TODAY

00:16:27.219 --> 00:16:28.320
AS A PROUD COAUTHOR OF SENATE

00:16:28.387 --> 00:16:30.956
BILL OR SENATE RESOLUTION 83,

00:16:31.023 --> 00:16:33.992
COMMEMORATING THE ANNIVERSARY OF

00:16:34.059 --> 00:16:35.094
THE ARMENIAN GENOCIDE. AND UP ON

