GOD BLESS YOU ALL. THANK YOU.

00:19:01.773 --> 00:19:03.976
AND I AM IN TOTAL SUPPORT OF SR

00:19:04.042 --> 00:19:04.977
83. THANK YOU, SENATOR

00:19:05.043 --> 00:19:11.884
