00:20:18.116 --> 00:20:19.084
RESOLUTION THAT WE HAVE BEFORE

00:20:19.151 --> 00:20:23.522
US. AS IT'S BEEN SAID, FROM 1915

00:20:23.589 --> 00:20:26.425
