00:20:33.966 --> 00:20:36.468
ASSYRIANS, GREEKS AND OTHER

00:20:36.535 --> 00:20:37.669
ETHNIC AND RELIGIOUS MINORITIES.

00:20:37.736 --> 00:20:40.973
THE THE GENOCIDE RESULTED IN THE

