00:20:42.774 --> 00:20:45.444
ARMENIANS. LET ME SAY THAT

00:20:45.510 --> 00:20:49.681
AGAIN. 1.5 MILLION PEOPLE WERE

00:20:49.748 --> 00:20:50.148
