00:20:53.385 --> 00:20:54.853
PERPETRATORS AND THE DENIERS OF

00:20:54.920 --> 00:20:56.021
THE FIRST GENOCIDE, THE ARMENIAN

00:20:56.088 --> 00:20:59.625
